.TH SDL_GetGlobalProperties 3 "SDL 3.5.0" "Simple Directmedia Layer" "SDL3 FUNCTIONS"
.SH NAME
SDL_GetGlobalProperties \- Get the global SDL properties.
.SH SYNOPSIS
.nf
.B #include <SDL3/SDL_properties.h>
.PP
.BI "SDL_PropertiesID SDL_GetGlobalProperties(void);
.fi
.SH RETURN VALUE
Returns a valid property ID on success or 0 on failure; call
.BR SDL_GetError ()
for more information\[char46]

.SH THREAD SAFETY
It is safe to call this function from any thread\[char46]

.SH AVAILABILITY
This function is available since SDL 3\[char46]2\[char46]0\[char46]

